            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 0
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 0
            as a natural number as well. One advantage of doing so is that a natural number can then be identified with the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cardinal+number"} cardinality
            of a
